WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Step 1: Ask any interview question. Top bar → AI Coach

1b
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Pick one predicted for your job, or type a question you were asked or expect.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Step 2: It reads your job and your material. AI Coach → choose the job at the top

2b
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The job’s requirements, your gaps, your resume and your saved stories.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Step 3: An outline with sources. AI Coach → Build my answer

3b
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Each point is labelled your resume, your story or general knowledge, with the words it came from.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Step 4: Your best example, ready to say. Result → Say it like this

4b
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
It picks your strongest example and writes a version to say out loud.

5
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Step 5: Numbers are checked. Result → Check these numbers

5b
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Any figure not in your material is flagged, so you never claim something you can’t back up.

6
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Step 6: Pick how it helps. AI Coach → the buttons under your question

6b
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.000
STAR it, explain a trade-off, outline a system design, or get the likely follow-ups.

7
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Step 7: Practise until it’s yours. Result → Practise this question

7b
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:49.000
Say it out loud, get scored, try again and see what improved. Save it to Your answers.
